WEBVTT

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.400
Earth... Our blue, shining planet.

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:16.410
But Earth never was as peaceful as we had always thought.

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:41.390
If your father ever dies...

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:53.990
Daichi?

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.240
Time to get up.

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:57.620
Gotcha...

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.660
The first semester of my second year of high school ends today.

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:08.210
In other words, summer break starts tomorrow.

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:16.090
I thought he quit the track team to focus on his studies...

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:20.180
Has he picked up any bad habits, like staying out late?

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.390
No, nothing like that.

00:01:22.390 --> 00:01:26.850
There must be some sort of reason for his grades to be slipping like this.

00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:29.360
I'm pretty much always playing in my room.

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:35.280
Some of that time was spent playing video games, of course.

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:40.030
But really, I spent most of my time reading books or just browsing the Internet.

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:43.290
Just kind of studying whatever interested me at the time.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:48.790
That said, I wasn't actually "studying" per se. Just screwing around.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.790
I'm fully aware of that.

00:01:51.790 --> 00:01:55.210
Look, you need to put more thought toward what you're going to do after high school.

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:58.050
Surely you have a dream you want to realize?

00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.220
Maybe you want to follow in your father's footsteps?

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.100
Sir...

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:01.760
Yes?

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:05.520
His father has nothing to do with his future plans.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:09.100
Right now, I...

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:14.400
I think there might be something wrong with me. With the way I am.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:20.620
But you know, I'm probably just imagining it.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:24.080
Frankly, I'm just trying to escape school because I don't feel like studying

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.830
anything they assign there.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:34.130
Impressive, Daichi...

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.300
Kagawa!

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:37.170
You're working?

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.590
My family owns this place.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:44.510
Is it okay for me to come over unannounced?

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:47.600
Nah, it's fine. My parents aren't home.

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:50.900
Come in.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:53.270
Oh, it's Daichi.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.070
I found him at the arcade.

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:57.530
Oh? Sasaki and Aizawa?

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.670
You're amazing, Daichi!

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:12.670
R-Really?

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.500
Hey. We should invite Daichi too.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.970
And if we do, Ayano will definitely come.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:21.630
Don't you think it would be better to have more people?

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:22.550
You're right.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:26.890
Hey, a few of us are planning a trip to a summer house in Izu.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.180
You guys want to come along?

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.390
A summer house?

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:35.570
Is your four-eyed old man going to make a fuss?

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.610
He isn't your real father though, right?

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.490
How'd you know?

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:43.530
Daichi's father was an astronaut.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.740
I'm amazed you know that.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.490
"Was"?

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.830
He's dead now.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:53.920
This footage was taken by a local resident.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:58.380
This strange, circular rainbow appeared in the sky over Minamitane

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:03.050
in Tanegashima for about five minutes, only to inexplicably vanish.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.140
Is it really you?

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:13.480
And now for tomorrow's national weather forecast...

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:15.100
Daichi?

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.150
What's going on?

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:19.150
Sorry... I won't be going to the summer house.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:20.610
But...

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.490
Thank you for inviting me.

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.210
It's huge!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.130
Hey...

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.890
That blue thing around your neck... What is it?

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:47.390
This?

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:49.220
It's called the Blue Star.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:51.890
My dad gave it to me.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.810
It is very pretty.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:55.850
By the way...

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:59.020
What is a "dad"?

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.030
When was it

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.280
that I began to hate the wind blowing through this town?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.460
Is this the Albion Rainbow?

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:21.090
Yeah, without a doubt.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:22.260
Moco!

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:27.760
You'll finally be able to pilot the
Machine: Goodfellow tomorrow!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.930
Yup, that's what I heard.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.810
At last, I'm going to be of some use.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:36.480
You know, you two are always together. Are you an item?

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:38.980
We are not!

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:41.570
We aren't like that at all.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.230
Really?

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.860
Then on our next day off, let's go on a date.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.200
Be careful, or I might take you seriously!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.320
You'd better!

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.790
It's harvest season.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.170
In spite of it all, we've found the final person

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.840
and the Machine: Goodfellow may activate.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:04.090
We are the planetary gears.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.550
And we represent the dreams of the world!

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:17.180
A dream, an echo singing of pleasant memories

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:27.240
It glows like that promise I'm sure we made

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:27.240
This is really starting to get interesting...

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:45.920
It reaches the lonely depths of my soul

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:55.510
It's reminding me of a wait somewhere someday

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:49.130
His temperature is down to thirty-eight degrees Celsius.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.390
That's excellent news.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:55.560
But his singularity is what's causing this phenomenon, isn't it?

00:06:55.510 --> 00:07:05.020
The future blooms in front of my eyes

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.680
Then he really was an avatar, after all.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:08.820
So I set off to seek you

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:08.280
Hey, did you see the news yesterday?

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.650
That circular rainbow, right?

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:15.240
To say our goodbyes

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.280
I wonder what it was...

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:12.320
Some weather phenomenon?

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.700
Seriously?

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:24.590
A dream, a love blooming like the sun in the sky

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.960
I've seen that rainbow before.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:34.220
It's the light of a day when it was my turn to do the protecting

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:26.710
Does it hurt?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.170
It doesn't hurt at all!

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:31.180
Anyway,

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:34.220
if you can do something that surprises me...

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:37.720
I'll give this to you!

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:41.440
If I were to...

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:44.610
jump from a spot higher than that fence, would you be surprised?

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:53.490
It's telling me that I lost nothing

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:47.650
No way... You can't jump from there!

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:49.650
W-W-Wait!

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.240
It does not hurt at all.

00:07:53.490 --> 00:08:02.870
Because the smile on your face never fades

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.540
Are you sure?

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:00.450
I promised, didn't I?

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:05.000
Okay, then if you can surprise me, I'll return it.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:11.510
Please, my dear future, don't cry

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:22.640
Our paths may meet again someday

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:13.680
Well?

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.730
The wind on this island feels pretty good, don't you think?

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:32.280
A dream, an echo singing of pleasant memories

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.070
My name is Manatsu Daichi.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.780
I am Arashi Teppei.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:34.610
Hey, Daichi...
You want to see one last amazing thing?

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:41.250
It glows like that promise I'm sure we made

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.240
Amazing?

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:46.040
It gently strokes my cheek

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:50.840
Like sunlight through the trees

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:51.460
That really is amazing, Teppei!

00:08:50.840 --> 00:09:00.720
And I tie it all into a bouquet meant for you

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:55.050
You're strange, Daichi.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:56.800
How?

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:04.520
Welcome to Tanegashima, The Island of Romance!

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.560
I've returned.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:18.820
I received a call from Toshiaki...

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:21.990
Your letter didn't say where you'd gone,

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.710
but he thought you'd probably come here.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.670
Once you're finished here, head home.

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:34.470
Hey...

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:38.140
Did my father really die in an accident?

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.310
Analyzing N.E.O.!

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:47.520
This...

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.100
appears to be an A.E.O.!

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:52.020
This is Star Emblem.

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.530
Initiating emergency launch sequence!

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:56.200
Wait, Taiyou! Think of Daichi!

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:59.110
Right now, this is the only thing we can use as an Impacter!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.840
Hey, Tsutomu...

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:18.010
Hope is believing that the future will be better than today.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:22.470
And real hope can only be created with our own choices!

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:26.680
Taiyou...

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:28.560
I'll stop it...

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.900
Because I'm a Captain!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:35.610
Tsutomu, I'm leaving Earth in your hands.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.000
He...

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:54.920
Your father... He was an admirable Captain.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:00.970
Captain?

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:04.940
Eyecatch

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:09.770
Daichi!

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:14.940
If your dad ever dies...

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.320
He's going to do it with a smile on his face.

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:26.790
I haven't returned to this island since the day my dad died in outer space.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:31.710
I think the last time I saw Teppei—and that girl—

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:35.090
was about three months before that.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:37.630
This way...

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.760
Over here.

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.260
You can get in through this door.

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:44.930
What? It's locked...

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.220
Isn't there another way in?

00:11:57.480 --> 00:11:58.480
That night...

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:03.820
Teppei said he'd show me something amazing, so I followed him.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.700
And at some point, everything went dark.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:14.630
It was then, beyond the darkness, that I saw her.

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.840
She never wakes up.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:48.370
Is it really you?

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:55.250
Hey, what is she holding?

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:02.880
Are you okay?

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.130
Daichi...

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.430
What's that?

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:15.230
After that night, I never saw them again.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.650
Of course it's locked...

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:21.400
Now, what do I do?

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.500
Now that I think about it,

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:40.090
being here alone is kind of scary.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.420
Wow, this is high!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:48.390
What? Am I really lost?

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:05.900
I definitely should have known better than to follow her.

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:09.030
This is Setsuna's capsule.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:10.990
I'm sure you realize this,

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:12.950
but you're not going to be able to stay out there very long.

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:14.870
So don't waste time.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:16.160
Got it.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.630
High-density libido charge firing!

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:26.510
Abreaction standby.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:59.960
It's been so long since I was my real self!

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.340
I'm reading an Entangle Gate and an A.E.O.!

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:13.970
Emergency message from Governor Yomatsuri aboard the <i>Tenkaidou</i>.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:19.310
Our observation satellites have detected an Approaching-Earth Object.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.520
It matches the Kill-T-Gang's manifestation pattern.

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.310
Roger that.

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:27.480
A.E.O.'s manifestation area lies within defensive zone 1.

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:30.360
Lambda sector, distance 360,000 kilometers.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.990
We have deployed the defensive zone 1 center Impacter.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:39.040
The Russian base's Markovs have already activated their intercept systems.

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:49.300
I got on...

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.680
Hey, how far down does this go?

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:55.430
The power went out?!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:02.730
Where... are we?

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:14.990
What's that?

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.550
What was that?

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:33.510
Is that thing heading toward Earth?!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.470
No!

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:42.770
If that reaches Earth, something terrible is going to happen...

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:44.310
Right?!

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:47.440
Mode change.

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:53.950
What do I do?

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.070
What should I do?

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:00.950
What am I supposed to do?

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.460
What can I do?!

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:15.630
What's this?

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.350
What are you doing there?

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.690
I'm surprised...

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:35.900
Do you know what it is you're holding?

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.700
Are you a Captain?

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.950
I'll ask again.

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:45.790
Are you a Captain?

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:52.340
Your father... He was an admirable Captain.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:57.180
I don't know if I'm a Captain or not...

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:00.680
But I have to stop that thing heading towards us!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.020
All Markovs have been destroyed.

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:14.070
The Kill-T-Gang is heading straight for Earth!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:15.940
Current distance 32,000 kilometers!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:18.280
Speed is 50 meters per second!

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:20.870
Any other Impacters within the Lambda sector?

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:21.530
Governor!

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:24.370
The expansion sequence has activated!

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.250
What?!

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.080
Constructing satellite chamber.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.590
Tidal Combine Gate creation is now possible.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.090
Course set.

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:37.510
Initiating countdown.

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.010
5...

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:39.590
4...

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:40.890
3...

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:41.760
2...

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:42.680
1.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:48.560
Sky Gate, Marine Gate, Road Gate...
Coordinates are all green!

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:50.770
Commander!

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:54.400
Alonzo has begun the Earth Engine emergency startup sequence!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:54.900
What?

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.940
The Pegasus rocket's launch pad is opening!

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:07.580
Emergency scramble fuel cartridge loaded!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.540
Pegasus rocket launching!

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:44.990
The Earth Engine's energy is charging!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:46.950
It's Orgone energy.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:48.870
Where's Teppei?

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:49.830
What about Livlaster?

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.710
Arashi Teppei isn't in the medical center.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.380
Livlaster Blossom located in the storage room.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.380
What's going on?

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:04.760
The Pegasus rocket is purging the Earth Engine.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:33.040
Relative vector adjustment...
Delta RV, Sigma 3.2.

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.000
2.6.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.460
0.7.

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.880
First expand!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.800
Tidal attractor functioning normally.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:46.260
Delta RV is within threshold limits.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:59.110
Combine robustness is at maximum.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.610
Second expand!

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.790
Preparing Orgone connection.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:20.550
All systems are go.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:22.340
Final expand!

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:04.630
The Engine series has expanded?

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:08.800
Then someone who can use the Livlaster has appeared?

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:12.890
To those of us in the Ark Faction, this is a serious concern.

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:17.850
We must not give those in the Intercept Faction any cause for hope.

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:19.810
I agree...

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:23.280
Especially those at Tanegashima.

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:30.240
Teppei!

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:34.120
The Earth Engine Impacter...

00:24:17.600 --> 00:24:19.350
My first battle in space...

00:24:19.350 --> 00:24:21.940
And I'm getting my butt kicked!

00:24:21.940 --> 00:24:24.850
Then, a mysterious flight director saves me.

00:24:25.730 --> 00:24:27.110
Who are you?

00:24:28.270 --> 00:24:30.690
A magical girl passing by?

00:24:30.690 --> 00:24:33.280
Next time, on episode 2 of Captain Earth:

00:24:33.280 --> 00:24:35.070
"The Name of the Gun Is Livlaster."

00:24:33.280 --> 00:24:35.070
The Name of the Gun Is Livlaster

00:24:35.410 --> 00:24:37.830
Earth Engine, expand!
